// Every one of these carries the whole order back, because the till redraws
// from it: a response that returned only what changed would leave the screen
// assembling state from two sources.
// A payment that cannot complete inside the software: a terminal to tap, a
// page for the customer to approve.
//
// The till sends them to url and asks for the sale again under the same
// idempotency key once the payment settles. Asking again is safe: the payment
